      possibleCards","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"d957b728-1ad7-44b8-b2b8-9c49c977d56c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":545.0,"yMin":-1722.0,"xMax":1426.0,"yMax":-1143.0},"label":"Check
      if there is an Ace in the AI''s hand - WRONG","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"fd7f314e-8643-450a-94ba-6874bc2ca21f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":18138.0,"yMin":-99.0,"xMax":18591.0,"yMax":223.0},"label":"Reset
      AI logic after switching to next player","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"12005813-c2d0-4bc1-a4d2-dcf89a5acee2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":546.0,"yMin":-855.0,"xMax":1260.0,"yMax":-549.0},"title":"Correct
      way to check if my AI has card in hand AND add them to possibleCards list","body":"\n1)
      Go trough my Cards In Hand (Game Objects) with For Each loop\n\n2) Get the
      Card Display component (from my Game Objects, I make a reference to the Card
      Display component which contains my Scriptable Objects)\n\n3) Get the Card
      Data component (the Card Data component is what it makes me possible to make
      a reference to my Scripting Objects from my GameObjects)\n\n4) Get Card Name
      (refers to my Scriptable Objects)\n-> This one is tricky : My Card Data component
      contains which specific Card is attached to it\nSo I can get my cards data
      (value, name, color, ...) from my Card Display component \n\n5) Connect my
      Get Card Data component to the Add Item node because it''s the direct reference
      from my Scriptable Objects\n \n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ce9ecae0-c65d-4a24-af16-d82853201a98","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-114.0,"yMin":-875.0,"xMax":131.0,"yMax":-778.0},"title":"Clear
      list ","body":"\nMake sure that there are NOT multiple time the same card stored
      in possibleCards list\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"7f6cb8d4-9c4a-42bf-9a9a-84a6a2029bdc","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":570.0,"yMin":-1547.0,"xMax":924.0,"yMax":-1428.0},"title":"List
      contains Item","body":"\nThe node cannot be used in this situation because
      :\n\n- It checks for EXACT GAMEOBJECT references\n- It does NOT check for properties
      \n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"6ddb391d-b94b-4a06-b872-d39fa8ee1b35","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":8418.0,"yMin":-1195.0,"xMax":8752.0,"yMax":-1008.0},"title":"Second
      For Each Loop","body":"\nI cannot use ScriptableOjects (from possibleCards)
      directly to make the AI plays its card \n-> it''s NOT GAMEOBJECTS\n\nInstead,
      the second For Each Loop is used to check if some cards displayed in the AI''s
      hand match the Card Data stored in the possibleCards list \n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"81833bac-ef53-4d21-ae9b-1e49b9dd2f68","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-3588.0,"yMin":868.0,"xMax":-2813.0,"yMax":1169.0},"title":"TO
      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":270.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"36"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-204.0,"y":60.0},"guid":"073df10a-97a9-45be-aee1-84c3a8cd354c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Update","$id":"935"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["name"],"member":{"name":"Find","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%name":{"$content":"PlayerAI1","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":421.0,"y":743.0},"guid":"099904fa-406c-4c42-b5ed-da8ded64f70b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"937"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[{"key":"In","label":"In","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"controlOutputDefinitions":[{"key":"Out","label":"Out","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"PlayerAI2","summary":null,"pan":{"x":-221.6974,"y":-124.0863},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-837.0,"y":-168.0},"guid":"554e3819-88f8-4f32-81b9-265cc5a8fc77","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphInput","$id":"953"},{"defaultValues":{"duration":{"$content":3.0,"$type":"System.Single"},"unscaledTime":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-448.0,"y":-169.0},"guid":"c64550af-1d23-4755-9d9f-7404713beee6","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Cooldown","$id":"955"},{"argumentCount":0,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"NextTurn","$type":"System.String